WEBVTT

00:07.048 --> 00:09.384
[sweet airy music]

00:43.001 --> 00:44.711
[Ji-ung] Aren't you
delighted to be out here?

00:45.628 --> 00:46.463
Yep.

00:46.546 --> 00:49.132
You always talked about wanting to relax
somewhere nice and serene,

00:49.215 --> 00:51.384
- and finally here you are.
- Yeah.

00:53.011 --> 00:54.721
Do you often go on outdoor trips?

00:55.722 --> 00:56.723
Yep.

00:58.183 --> 00:59.267
[sighs]

01:00.477 --> 01:02.270
What was the most memorable one?

01:05.648 --> 01:07.692
[Ji-ung] Which trip was
the most memorable for you?

01:07.776 --> 01:09.444
[gentle music]

01:10.278 --> 01:12.280
[Ung] Even if I don't want to remember,

01:12.363 --> 01:15.450
there's was this one trip we had,
I'll never forget it.

01:15.533 --> 01:16.826
Something stuck in your ear, Ung?

01:17.619 --> 01:19.079
[Ung] There was also that time…

01:21.039 --> 01:22.499
Hey, Ung.

01:24.501 --> 01:25.543
TWO DAYS BEFORE UNG'S DEPARTURE

01:25.627 --> 01:27.003
Hey, hey, Ung.

01:28.505 --> 01:29.881
[Ung] …I was with Yeon-su.

01:33.593 --> 01:35.220
[Yeon-su] Hey, Ung.

01:35.303 --> 01:39.557
Hey, Ung. Hey, Ung. Hey, Ung.

01:43.603 --> 01:44.437
[sighs]

01:44.521 --> 01:46.022
Are you ignoring me?

01:46.940 --> 01:49.067
[inhales]
I thought we already broke up?

01:49.150 --> 01:51.319
Oh, really? Did we now?

01:51.402 --> 01:52.695
[sighs]

01:52.779 --> 01:55.740
How can you just tell me
to take the offer, like it's no big deal?

01:55.824 --> 01:58.785
Because it's what you should do.
Plus, the school will pay for it.

01:58.868 --> 02:01.663
So you're really okay
with being apart for six long months?

02:02.872 --> 02:06.042
Well. This is a great opportunity for you
to hone your skillset.

02:06.709 --> 02:08.002
Of course, you should go.

02:13.550 --> 02:14.717
Let's take a trip.

02:14.801 --> 02:17.512
You can go alone.
I'll be on a long one soon anyway.

02:18.513 --> 02:20.348
We need to hurry. There's no time left.

02:20.431 --> 02:21.516
Hurry up where?

02:21.599 --> 02:23.893
You wanted to see the sea, right?
Let's go.

02:23.977 --> 02:24.811
Right now?

02:24.894 --> 02:28.106
[Ung] I had no say on that trip,
and I had none in this one either.

02:28.189 --> 02:30.316
Yup. Already got the bus tickets already.
Come on.

02:31.109 --> 02:34.028
Wait a second. Why didn't you
at least tell me about this sooner?

02:34.112 --> 02:37.574
SUWON, JANGAN, HOGOK-RI

02:37.657 --> 02:38.658
[Yeon-su hums in delight]

02:38.741 --> 02:40.160
Well, we can already smell the sea.

02:40.243 --> 02:41.661
[Ung] You can't even call it a trip.

02:41.744 --> 02:43.204
Who and what is this trip for anyway?

02:43.288 --> 02:46.666
There's no time. We need to hurry
if we want to catch the bus back. Come on.

02:46.749 --> 02:48.084
Is this what I think it is?

02:48.168 --> 02:49.085
What?

02:50.545 --> 02:51.754
Our final trip together?

02:53.256 --> 02:54.966
[Ung] How could I forget that trip?

02:55.049 --> 02:56.801
I said hurry up. We don't have time.

02:57.510 --> 02:59.512
- [Yeon-su] Thank you so much.
- [waitress] You two enjoy that.

02:59.596 --> 03:03.308
Oh. Check out how beautiful that looks.
Makes you hungry just by looking.

03:05.560 --> 03:06.394
Wow.

03:06.477 --> 03:08.396
It's my treat, little guy, so eat up.

03:09.105 --> 03:10.106
Here.

03:11.691 --> 03:13.610
What is this?
The The Last Supper or something?

03:14.277 --> 03:16.779
Look at how plump this is.
I've never had this before.

03:18.990 --> 03:21.159
So you're gonna treat me
to a nice, fancy meal

03:21.242 --> 03:22.619
and then leave me here, aren't you?

03:23.328 --> 03:24.579
Shut up and eat.

03:25.580 --> 03:27.290
Eat it up. It is going to be a busy day.

03:27.957 --> 03:29.667
[Ung] She just did whatever she wanted to.

03:32.795 --> 03:33.671
[groans]

03:33.755 --> 03:35.715
All right, stay still.

03:35.798 --> 03:36.716
On my own?

03:36.799 --> 03:38.718
Just smile.
Look at how many people are waiting.

03:38.801 --> 03:41.387
- But wait. Shouldn't we take it together?
- All right.

03:41.471 --> 03:43.223
I knew it, this is our final trip.

03:43.306 --> 03:44.807
You're breaking up with me, aren't you?

03:44.891 --> 03:46.809
[Ung] I could never
get a proper read on her.

03:46.893 --> 03:48.144
One, two, three.

03:48.228 --> 03:49.646
[camera clicks, whirs]

03:51.189 --> 03:52.482
That's it. Let's go.

03:53.524 --> 03:55.485
[soft music]

03:59.155 --> 04:01.366
- [waves crashing]
- [seagulls cawing]

04:05.203 --> 04:07.497
[Ung] Can't you just
let me appreciate the view for a bit?

04:07.580 --> 04:09.332
You need photos to reminisce.

04:09.999 --> 04:12.085
I just wanna ponder a little while.

04:12.877 --> 04:13.711
About what?

04:14.295 --> 04:16.047
About our future together after this.

04:16.130 --> 04:19.133
Uh. Why bother
thinking about that while on a trip?

04:19.217 --> 04:20.260
I was thinking back home,

04:20.343 --> 04:22.470
but then you dragged me
all the way out here.

04:22.553 --> 04:24.138
[chuckles]
Take a look at this.

04:24.222 --> 04:26.182
You kind of look like a wild water deer.

04:27.100 --> 04:29.310
Are you even listening
to anything I'm saying here?

04:29.894 --> 04:32.105
What a shame.
It would have been better during the day.

04:33.106 --> 04:35.441
[Ung] She never cared
about anything I said back then.

04:35.525 --> 04:36.359
[sighs]

04:36.442 --> 04:39.237
Hey. Why not just smiling?

04:39.320 --> 04:41.739
Feels like I'm talking
to a noisy brick wall.

04:42.573 --> 04:44.242
[gasps]
Uh-oh. We're running out of time.

04:44.325 --> 04:45.576
We need to go to the market. Quick!

04:46.327 --> 04:47.996
Hey, let's go.

04:50.123 --> 04:52.166
[bright music]

04:52.250 --> 04:53.710
[panting]

05:01.676 --> 05:03.761
[bright music]

05:06.222 --> 05:07.765
[vendor] Take a good look.

05:07.849 --> 05:09.642
Which one would you like?

05:09.726 --> 05:12.437
- That's right. Freshly caught guaranteed.
- Can I touch it?

05:12.520 --> 05:13.938
[vendor] Of course, of course.

05:14.439 --> 05:16.441
- [squeals]
- Ah! Hey!

05:16.524 --> 05:19.110
Look at that. Oh, come on.

05:20.486 --> 05:23.031
[salesman] Yes, it's very fresh.
I guarantee it.

05:25.783 --> 05:28.286
[shoppers chatting]

05:31.122 --> 05:32.123
Let's go.

05:34.625 --> 05:35.710
[Ung] And also…

05:37.128 --> 05:38.212
Oh, look at that.

05:38.296 --> 05:45.261
SUWON, JANGAN, HOGOK-RI

05:55.229 --> 05:57.482
Pretty fun trip, right? Had fun?

06:02.779 --> 06:03.863
Ung?

06:18.252 --> 06:20.421
You always frown in your sleep.
I don't know why.

06:23.800 --> 06:25.593
- [yawns]
- Here you go.

06:31.432 --> 06:34.602
Next time, we should go on a longer trip.
Like for several days.

06:37.313 --> 06:39.690
I got an extra part-time job,
so I've been way too busy.

06:40.483 --> 06:42.360
I was supposed
to take the morning shift off

06:42.443 --> 06:43.820
but they wouldn't let me.

06:45.321 --> 06:46.948
Pretty hectic day, wasn't it?

06:47.615 --> 06:49.992
This was my first trip,
so I'm not used to it.

06:51.202 --> 06:54.330
Next time, we should stay longer
and go much farther.

06:55.498 --> 06:57.375
You want me to tag along with you again?

06:57.458 --> 06:59.877
Well, who else should I be with?
I'm not going alone.

07:00.711 --> 07:03.297
[Ung] Classic Yeon-su.
She was always like that.

07:04.757 --> 07:07.468
Why? You think we're breaking up?

07:07.552 --> 07:09.637
You can't be that dense?

07:09.720 --> 07:11.389
You ever think
maybe you should have told me

07:11.472 --> 07:13.432
instead of making me feel anxious all day?

07:13.516 --> 07:15.143
I'm not spelling it out. That's dumb.

07:15.226 --> 07:16.227
Can't you just guess?

07:16.310 --> 07:18.438
Hmm. I can't. Never could anyway.

07:18.521 --> 07:21.232
You need to speak up,
I can't read you like you want me to.

07:21.858 --> 07:23.860
[soft music]

07:27.864 --> 07:28.865
Choi Ung.

07:32.118 --> 07:32.994
Hey, Ung.

07:39.417 --> 07:40.376
Look at me.

07:44.547 --> 07:46.048
We're not gonna break up.

07:48.259 --> 07:51.762
If we ever fight again or stop talking,

07:53.014 --> 07:56.225
all you have to do is come to me,
you know, just like you did today.

07:58.227 --> 08:00.354
- And then what?
- And then I'll…

08:02.523 --> 08:04.775
[unheard whispers]

08:07.028 --> 08:09.780
[soft sweet music]

08:13.576 --> 08:14.410
[chuckles]

08:14.494 --> 08:16.871
Where was that smile
when you were taking photos?

08:16.954 --> 08:18.706
They're all I have to look at you're gone.

08:19.290 --> 08:21.209
Wait, that's the only reason
why you took them?

08:21.709 --> 08:23.794
You know what? Let's take one now.

08:23.878 --> 08:25.338
- Right here?
- Yes.

08:26.088 --> 08:27.048
[clears throat]

08:27.757 --> 08:29.467
- [camera whirs]
- Now. Okay. Smile.

08:32.345 --> 08:34.680
[Ung] Sometimes, she'd feel very distant.

08:34.764 --> 08:36.766
Other times, she'd pull me closer…

08:38.976 --> 08:40.144
Just take it already!

08:46.317 --> 08:49.445
What is it? Is my smile really that bad?

08:54.200 --> 08:55.493
It's just…

08:55.576 --> 08:57.537
I think that I'm in love with you.

08:59.080 --> 09:03.584
[Ung] And just like that,
a heartbeat can stretch on forever.

09:05.753 --> 09:07.129
Couldn't you tell it was?

09:07.213 --> 09:09.257
["Summer Rain" by Sam Kim playing]

09:13.386 --> 09:14.512
I couldn't.

09:19.684 --> 09:20.851
I'm dense like that.

09:22.728 --> 09:24.146
You have to remind me.

09:28.150 --> 09:29.902
[Ung] How could I forget that moment?

09:34.574 --> 09:35.449
[sighs]

09:35.533 --> 09:37.034
I had no idea back then.

09:41.706 --> 09:42.707
[sips]

09:45.835 --> 09:46.919
[Ung] I'm not sure.

09:48.004 --> 09:49.922
Don't really enjoy
going on trips and stuff.

09:51.757 --> 09:53.843
You can go on a trip and make promises…

09:53.926 --> 09:55.636
Nothing fun or memorable about it.

09:55.720 --> 09:58.139
…fake ones, that you don't have to keep.

10:04.478 --> 10:10.067
EPISODE 8
BEFORE SUNSET

10:11.694 --> 10:14.280
[Eun-ho] Honestly, I don't know
what's going on with those two.

10:14.363 --> 10:15.656
I tagged along just in case.

10:16.240 --> 10:17.867
But I suspect that something's not right.

10:17.950 --> 10:20.369
For those two,
this isn't their usual tone.

10:21.203 --> 10:23.205
You see,
Ung has always been irresponsible,

10:23.289 --> 10:25.833
so it's normal for him
to run away or not pick up my calls.

10:25.916 --> 10:28.085
But Yeon-su
is also running away in parallel.

10:28.169 --> 10:30.546
So because of that
and using my deduction skills,

10:31.130 --> 10:33.132
for sure something
might have happened between those two.

10:33.215 --> 10:35.134
Anyway, I'm not here to relax or anything.

10:35.217 --> 10:38.095
I'm here to… how do I put it?
To observe and assess.

10:40.389 --> 10:42.600
Such is the burden of being his manager.

10:43.476 --> 10:45.728
It's my duty to nurture his mental health.

10:46.687 --> 10:48.356
They'll figure it out eventually.

10:48.439 --> 10:50.733
After all, they're not kids.
Not like you could tell.

10:51.817 --> 10:54.153
Because seeing how immature
they still are, it's like

10:54.236 --> 10:56.322
the only one getting older here is me.

10:57.907 --> 10:59.784
[squeals]

10:59.867 --> 11:01.786
I don't know how this got here.

11:01.869 --> 11:03.537
Is there someplace I can swim around here?

11:03.621 --> 11:05.039
- Like an indoor pool?
- [chuckles]

11:05.748 --> 11:09.335
Anyway, you guys were smart
to kidnap and lock them up in here.

11:09.418 --> 11:12.046
Bunch of extremely irresponsible kids.

11:13.255 --> 11:15.424
Pretty sure I brought some hangover pills.
[clears throat]

11:15.508 --> 11:17.426
[Chae-ran] I heard you've known those two
for a very long time.

11:17.510 --> 11:18.344
Back when they were students.

11:19.011 --> 11:21.222
Would you say
that they have changed since then?

11:22.473 --> 11:23.391
Mm…

11:24.016 --> 11:27.436
To be honest with you, not a single bit.

11:27.520 --> 11:29.980
Truth is, they were
a pain in the ass back then,

11:30.064 --> 11:31.690
and they still are.

11:31.774 --> 11:35.194
For real, they're kind of a nuisance
to everyone who tolerates them.

11:35.277 --> 11:36.112
[clears throat]

11:36.612 --> 11:38.155
Speaking of, where are they anyway?

11:38.948 --> 11:40.616
Don't tell me they're arguing again.

11:40.699 --> 11:42.743
[quirky music]

11:48.791 --> 11:50.793
[Ung] Things have
taken a turn for the worse.

11:51.710 --> 11:54.755
Why the hell did we have
to go on this ridiculous trip?

11:56.507 --> 11:58.676
[wind gusting]

12:05.057 --> 12:07.059
[water gushing]

12:14.108 --> 12:17.403
You know, if you were going to run away,
you should have gone farther.

12:17.486 --> 12:18.612
[scoffs]

12:18.696 --> 12:21.115
That's rich, but you didn't even
put up a struggle.

12:22.825 --> 12:24.743
So, what now? You giving up?

12:25.578 --> 12:27.288
You're just gonna let them do this?

12:28.164 --> 12:30.291
What? Not like I have any choice in this.

12:34.295 --> 12:35.337
[breathes in sharply]

12:37.173 --> 12:38.591
Thought you were sick of it.

12:40.801 --> 12:43.679
If you really couldn't stand me,
you wouldn't be here right now.

12:46.265 --> 12:48.559
[gentle music]

12:56.358 --> 12:57.985
Finally went on another one, huh?

12:58.068 --> 12:59.820
[Yeon-su] Next time,
we should stay longer.

12:59.904 --> 13:01.113
And it's longer.

13:01.197 --> 13:02.740
[Yeon-su] And go much farther.

13:02.823 --> 13:03.866
And farther.

13:05.951 --> 13:06.869
What?

13:09.705 --> 13:13.501
I'm sure you agree on some level.
I know that you're sick of this.

13:15.336 --> 13:18.339
We fight, we run away,
and then we avoid each other.

13:18.422 --> 13:19.632
[Ung] That's what we do.

13:20.508 --> 13:21.967
But despite that, we're here.

13:22.885 --> 13:24.637
[inhales]
What can we do, right?

13:25.971 --> 13:28.015
[soft music]

13:36.941 --> 13:38.317
Do you need to be alone?

13:41.028 --> 13:42.821
It's fine, I'll just leave.

13:49.078 --> 13:51.163
[soft music continues]

13:54.542 --> 13:55.793
[sighs]

13:58.587 --> 14:02.091
[Ung] What's with the bad timing?
Why'd I remember all that?

14:02.174 --> 14:03.551
[sighs]

14:05.719 --> 14:06.762
[groans]

14:08.389 --> 14:10.099
[birds chirping]

14:16.272 --> 14:18.691
Wow. Hell of a view.

14:19.525 --> 14:21.777
Any reason you're breathing down my neck?

14:22.778 --> 14:23.904
Just being observant, sir.

14:23.988 --> 14:25.823
Looking forward
to learning many things from you.

14:25.906 --> 14:28.450
Watching every little thing you do.
Not gonna dismiss a thing.

14:28.534 --> 14:32.037
The only thing getting dismissed here
is you, unless you take two steps back.

14:34.331 --> 14:35.624
I know I already said this,

14:35.708 --> 14:37.668
but I'm truly glad
to be a part of your team, sir.

14:37.751 --> 14:40.546
Both you and Ms. Jung
are such an inspiration to me.

14:40.629 --> 14:41.881
And I'm very eager to learn a lot.

14:41.964 --> 14:43.799
You sound like a parrot repeating things.

14:43.883 --> 14:44.842
Oh.

14:46.468 --> 14:48.262
You need to remember
that you have two jobs.

14:48.345 --> 14:49.555
Absolutely anything, sir!

14:49.638 --> 14:52.766
One. When Chae-ran asks you for something,
I want you to have it way before.

14:52.850 --> 14:54.310
- I can do that. Yes, sir.
- And two.

14:54.393 --> 14:57.479
I don't want you blocking my view,
especially when I'm panning the camera.

15:01.650 --> 15:03.235
Show me what you'll do here.

15:05.613 --> 15:06.780
That's it. Simple, right?

15:06.864 --> 15:07.781
[groans]

15:08.282 --> 15:10.576
Anyway, sir,
I promise I'll do my very best.

15:10.659 --> 15:13.370
I know you're giving me the rough
treatment because you think I'll give up,

15:13.454 --> 15:15.331
just like the ones before.
Not gonna happen.

15:15.414 --> 15:17.791
All you're ever gonna get
is the best that I can give you.

15:17.875 --> 15:20.169
I can assure you right now,
tenacity is my middle name.

15:20.252 --> 15:22.504
I've got persistence
like you've never seen.

15:26.383 --> 15:29.386
And someday, I'm gonna become
a competent producer just like you.

15:30.137 --> 15:33.015
Mr. Park told us you were pretty much
a trainwreck when you started.

15:33.098 --> 15:34.934
You were screwing up all your projects.

15:35.017 --> 15:36.477
- [sighs]
- But thanks to his guidance,

15:36.560 --> 15:38.854
you became the awesome producer
that you are now.

15:44.026 --> 15:44.985
[chuckles]

15:45.069 --> 15:47.321
What the hell are you doing, intern?

15:47.404 --> 15:50.658
I'm doing the same thing.
Learning and growing just like you did.

15:52.534 --> 15:55.120
I get butterflies before shooting.
My heart beats like crazy.

15:59.625 --> 16:00.960
[stammers]

16:01.043 --> 16:02.252
I really do mean it.

16:02.336 --> 16:03.504
[Tae-hun chuckles]

16:03.587 --> 16:06.799
Honestly, this is the most exciting
part of my life. I bet you feel the same.

16:06.882 --> 16:09.259
Hey, how about you cut the crap
and go look for Chae-ran.

16:09.343 --> 16:10.844
- She probably needs your help.
- Right.

16:10.928 --> 16:12.721
Where are you taking that?

16:12.805 --> 16:13.973
Uh, right.

16:15.057 --> 16:16.058
[sighs]

16:16.141 --> 16:18.185
[quirky music]

16:20.813 --> 16:22.648
Who gets butterflies from this?

16:22.731 --> 16:24.733
[birds chirping]

16:32.574 --> 16:34.702
[soft music]

16:52.678 --> 16:54.930
[soft music continues]

16:58.976 --> 17:00.144
- [gasping]
- Oh, my God.

17:01.228 --> 17:03.647
- What do you think you're doing here?
- Oh, I'm so sorry, sir.

17:03.731 --> 17:06.442
Is it okay if I take
just a few more photos from here?

17:06.525 --> 17:08.527
- You mean from here?
- Yes, that's right, sir.

17:08.610 --> 17:12.072
Because isn't this place
the same one we're in front of right now?

17:13.115 --> 17:14.074
SEOUL HARDWARE

17:14.658 --> 17:16.076
SEOUL HARDWARE

17:16.702 --> 17:18.245
Yeah, you're right.
It's the same building.

17:18.328 --> 17:19.788
See? I told you it's the same.

17:19.872 --> 17:22.750
Look, it's uncanny. Apparently,
he drew a lot from this neighborhood.

17:23.584 --> 17:25.544
Sir, we need to ask,
do you recognize this place?

17:26.128 --> 17:27.546
[fan] It should be nearby.

17:27.629 --> 17:28.630
Hold on a sec.

17:29.131 --> 17:32.593
Oh, yeah, I do. That's the flower shop
just over by that corner.

17:32.676 --> 17:35.387
- Let's go check it out. Thank you so much.
- Thank you so much.

17:35.471 --> 17:38.766
By the way, what is this thing right here?

17:40.726 --> 17:41.643
[Chang-sik] Ho!

17:41.727 --> 17:42.686
WITH UNG
MEALS WITH RICE

17:42.770 --> 17:45.647
Hey, Chang-sik.
Didn't you already stop by this morning?

17:45.731 --> 17:48.442
Could have sworn you've been here.
Once a day will do you don't have to

17:48.525 --> 17:50.486
- come back all the time.
- Hey, I got news for you.

17:50.569 --> 17:52.946
Ung must have really slayed
when he did that drawing show.

17:53.030 --> 17:55.491
- My son didn't slay anyone.
- No, you're not listening.

17:55.574 --> 17:57.284
Some tourists came by my store just now

17:57.367 --> 17:59.745
and took photos of themselves
with the building. Yeah.

17:59.828 --> 18:00.662
You wanna know why?

18:00.746 --> 18:03.415
They said they came 'cause they saw
my store in one of his drawings.

18:03.499 --> 18:04.875
Oh, is that so?

18:05.417 --> 18:06.585
[Chang-sik] "Is that so"?

18:06.668 --> 18:11.131
What the hell? Aren't you even…
aren't you even surprised?

18:11.215 --> 18:12.549
Come here. Let me show you.

18:14.676 --> 18:16.678
- Oh, enjoy the food people.
- Thank you so much.

18:16.762 --> 18:18.597
- [Ho] Tell me if you need anything.
- Thank you!

18:19.098 --> 18:21.141
- Plenty more where that came from.
- [customers chatter]

18:21.225 --> 18:24.061
Stop staring at them.
They're trying to eat in peace. It's rude.

18:24.144 --> 18:25.813
I did find it strange.

18:25.896 --> 18:28.232
All of a sudden, we had
this influx of young customers

18:28.315 --> 18:30.109
which never happened to us before.

18:30.192 --> 18:31.902
Oh, then I realized.

18:31.985 --> 18:34.780
My son has gained
quite a following on social media.

18:35.364 --> 18:38.784
You know what, I think I'll hang
his drawings here, all over this wall.

18:38.867 --> 18:41.537
Right? In the alley as well.
All over the walls.

18:41.620 --> 18:42.579
I'm gonna plaster them.

18:42.663 --> 18:44.873
Then who knows, the alley
might turn into a popular tourist spot.

18:44.957 --> 18:47.292
What are you doing standing there?
Help me inside.

18:47.376 --> 18:48.252
In a minute.

18:48.335 --> 18:52.381
And I'm planning on wearing a name tag,
so that the customers will know who I am.

18:52.464 --> 18:53.674
It'll say "Ung's Father".

18:53.757 --> 18:55.634
Or maybe a cap
embroidered with something cool.

18:55.717 --> 18:57.511
Like, "Ung's daddy. Relax people."

18:57.594 --> 18:59.555
- [Yeon-ok] Hurry up.
- Yeah, I'll be right there.

19:00.222 --> 19:01.598
His drawings…

19:02.349 --> 19:03.809
SEOUL HARDWARE

19:04.810 --> 19:06.603
…please, please can I have one?

19:13.569 --> 19:14.736
[phone buzzing]

19:15.904 --> 19:17.573
[birds chirping]

19:21.952 --> 19:24.037
[Yi-hun] Our latest project was a success.

19:24.121 --> 19:25.789
Good job, everyone.

19:25.873 --> 19:27.708
Soen is very pleased with the turnout.

19:27.791 --> 19:30.210
[Myeong-ho] All thanks to Ms. Kook
putting it all together.

19:30.294 --> 19:32.880
[Ji-un] I agree. Ms. Kook,
thank you for your hard work.

19:32.963 --> 19:35.257
[Ye-in] Ms. Kook, hope you have
a great vacation out there.

19:35.340 --> 19:36.466
Good luck on the documentary.

19:36.550 --> 19:38.385
Oh. Did you read the news today?

19:38.468 --> 19:40.345
Everyone loves Go-oh.
They think he's awesome. 

19:40.429 --> 19:41.555
Here's a link to the article.

19:43.432 --> 19:44.433
GO-OH AND SOEN'S SYNERGY

19:44.516 --> 19:46.560
[light music]

19:51.231 --> 19:53.150
WHO IS GO-OH?
NJ AND GO-OH'S SPECIAL RELATIONSHIP

19:59.031 --> 20:01.450
NJ AND GO-OH'S SPECIAL RELATIONSHIP

20:02.075 --> 20:03.744
GO-OH RECEIVED FLOWERS FROM NJ

20:05.120 --> 20:07.664
[light music continues]

20:12.044 --> 20:14.254
It's nothing special.
What does that even mean?

20:17.132 --> 20:18.759
[Ji-ung] Having fun mumbling to yourself?

20:18.842 --> 20:21.053
No, I… Wait. Were you filming me?

20:21.970 --> 20:24.139
Well, filming is a part of my job.

20:24.723 --> 20:26.350
But I don't do it in secret,
so don't worry.

20:27.100 --> 20:29.019
As I said before,
I'm not into that shady style.

20:29.102 --> 20:30.938
- So kidnapping me wasn't shady at all?
- [scoffs]

20:31.021 --> 20:33.523
You would have run away
the moment I mentioned anything.

20:33.607 --> 20:35.817
Don't even bother.
I lost trust in the both of you.

20:35.901 --> 20:37.736
You'll get after-action reports.
Don't worry.

20:37.819 --> 20:39.571
You know. You're getting
more and more annoying lately.

20:39.655 --> 20:41.865
Not my problem.
That's what you get for bailing on us.

20:41.949 --> 20:43.992
Probably shouldn't have run away
and made things worse.

20:44.076 --> 20:46.203
I wouldn't have
if I knew this was going to happen.

20:46.286 --> 20:47.704
[scoffs, inhales]

20:47.788 --> 20:50.582
Since you're here, you might as well
take your mind off things.

20:50.666 --> 20:51.708
[Ji-ung] Try to relax.

20:51.792 --> 20:54.294
In front of the camera? Wow. How relaxing.

20:55.921 --> 20:58.257
Was there anything
you wanted to do on a trip like this?

20:58.340 --> 21:00.425
[Yeon-su] I'm not sure.
I never thought about stuff like this.

21:00.509 --> 21:02.386
[Ji-ung] Try and think of something.
I'll make it happen.

21:02.469 --> 21:04.846
[Yeon-su] So you can use this
to spruce up your documentary?

21:04.930 --> 21:07.057
[chuckles]
Jesus Christ.

21:08.100 --> 21:09.476
[line trilling]

21:13.188 --> 21:15.440
[Mi-yeon] Okay. So how's it going lately?

21:15.524 --> 21:16.608
What to what?

21:16.692 --> 21:20.320
That artist you had a crush on.
What? Is it already over?

21:20.404 --> 21:22.364
Don't be absurd. It has barely even begun.

21:23.031 --> 21:24.950
I'm still working on it, kind of…

21:26.118 --> 21:27.619
but I did shock him by confessing.

21:27.703 --> 21:31.540
Again? Why am I not surprised anymore.

21:31.623 --> 21:34.293
What's that supposed to mean?
Getting a little conscious?

21:34.376 --> 21:36.211
You can't just act surprised
every now and then?

21:36.295 --> 21:37.796
If I was born looking like that,

21:37.879 --> 21:40.048
I would have seduced
every single man out there

21:40.132 --> 21:41.675
and made them confess their love for me.

21:42.467 --> 21:44.886
I don't get
why it always has to be you confessing.

21:45.554 --> 21:47.764
And what's so wrong
about expressing my feelings?

21:48.598 --> 21:50.475
I guess this is exactly
why you're still single.

21:50.559 --> 21:54.146
Interesting. Does that mean
you're in a relationship now?

21:54.771 --> 21:58.692
Well, for now, all I did was confess
how I thought in the safest way I could.

21:58.775 --> 22:01.945
He's probably still in shock.
He needs some time to think.

22:02.029 --> 22:03.322
He is all confused.

22:03.905 --> 22:06.366
All it will take is for me
to give him just one call,

22:06.450 --> 22:08.160
and then it's smooth sailing from there.

22:08.243 --> 22:09.119
MR. CHOI UNG

22:09.202 --> 22:10.579
[chuckles]

22:11.371 --> 22:12.497
[dial tone]

22:13.081 --> 22:15.876
[operator] The person you are calling
is unavailable at this time.

22:15.959 --> 22:17.586
Please try again later.

22:18.378 --> 22:19.838
Now what? He won't pick up?

22:20.505 --> 22:21.423
[Mi-yeon sighs]

22:21.506 --> 22:24.468
Weird how he's not picking up
after you confessed how you felt.

22:25.719 --> 22:27.179
It is fascinating in a way.

22:27.262 --> 22:30.974
[Mi-yeon] Hey, you're not done here yet.
Where do you think you're going?

22:31.058 --> 22:33.685
After everything I've done,
why isn't he picking up my call?

22:33.769 --> 22:36.188
[Chae-ran] This concludes
the interview segment of this shoot.

22:36.271 --> 22:38.732
From here on, you can just spend this time
doing whatever you want,

22:38.815 --> 22:40.108
and we'll do is film you.

22:40.192 --> 22:42.277
Any suggestions on
what you'd each like to do?

22:47.240 --> 22:49.034
Can I just lie down for a while?

22:49.993 --> 22:50.952
I don't see why not.

22:51.036 --> 22:53.497
[Ji-ung] 80 percent of your footage
is you lying down anyway,

22:53.580 --> 22:54.706
so keep up the good job.

22:54.790 --> 22:57.876
Not like making that into 90 percent
is gonna make much of a difference.

22:57.959 --> 22:59.377
In fact, just lie down forever.

23:01.129 --> 23:03.131
Damn it. Let's wrap up.

23:05.550 --> 23:08.762
Hey, do you guys know how long it takes
to reach downtown? It took ages.

23:08.845 --> 23:10.138
- [sighs]
- [Chae-ran] Hey, intern.

23:10.222 --> 23:12.099
How much are you planning
to cost our production?

23:12.182 --> 23:13.475
She said they were necessary.

23:13.558 --> 23:15.602
Come on, there's a lot of us.
This isn't much.

23:15.685 --> 23:16.728
I won't bankrupt you.

23:16.812 --> 23:18.313
Sol-i is an excellent cook, you guys.

23:18.396 --> 23:20.190
I really don't get
why her business is failing.

23:20.273 --> 23:21.775
Shut up and eat your ice cream.

23:24.486 --> 23:25.320
What's this?

23:26.196 --> 23:28.990
[Sol-i] Great, we also paid
for someone else's stuff. Don't need that.

23:30.158 --> 23:31.910
- [Sol-i] What? You wanna have it?
- [Eun-ho] I did.

23:31.993 --> 23:33.411
[Sol-i] Too bad, 'cause it's my favorite.

23:36.414 --> 23:37.749
[Ji-ung] Are you gonna draw?

23:38.333 --> 23:40.335
Hmm. What else can I do here?

23:40.418 --> 23:41.336
Where are you going?

23:41.419 --> 23:42.963
Not too far, don't worry about it.

23:43.672 --> 23:45.465
I saw a lot of beautiful trees out there.

23:46.049 --> 23:47.717
Hey, you need to wear
thicker clothes than that.

23:47.801 --> 23:48.885
It's cold in the mountains.

23:48.969 --> 23:50.679
I'm not gonna go with you.

23:50.762 --> 23:52.681
What? You're not?

23:52.764 --> 23:54.558
Chae-ran's gonna be following you.

23:55.267 --> 23:56.143
What about you?

23:56.226 --> 23:59.729
I'm gonna be tagging along with Yeon-su.
We're gonna check out the village nearby.

24:00.647 --> 24:03.483
Oh. Cool. Suit yourself.

24:04.734 --> 24:07.237
- Are you ready?
- Well, not like I need to get ready.

24:07.320 --> 24:08.572
So it's really a free day?

24:09.322 --> 24:11.158
Of course it is. You can do whatever.

24:12.492 --> 24:13.535
Hey.

24:14.953 --> 24:16.788
What… what time do I need to get back?

24:16.872 --> 24:18.331
[breathes in sharply]

24:18.415 --> 24:20.542
Around whatever time you want.

24:20.625 --> 24:23.211
Okay, but this is the country,
it's gonna get dark soon.

24:23.920 --> 24:25.589
Try coming back a lot earlier.

24:26.256 --> 24:28.008
- Hey, Ung. Let's go.
- [Ji-ung] Okay.

24:30.302 --> 24:31.261
"Hey, Ung"?

24:32.429 --> 24:34.347
As if those two were ever that close.

24:35.140 --> 24:36.975
[scoffs]
I'm speechless.

24:38.685 --> 24:40.103
I'm Ung, not him.

24:43.440 --> 24:45.442
[Yeon-su] I've been feeling
frustrated lately.

24:45.525 --> 24:47.903
But now that I'm here,
I feel a little bit liberated.

24:47.986 --> 24:50.655
Well, there's a sense
of relief at least, I guess.

24:50.739 --> 24:54.784
Also, it's been ages
since I've gone on a proper vacation.

24:56.036 --> 24:59.080
Actually, I've never
really taken any breaks at all.

24:59.164 --> 25:00.916
I probably don't know how to relax.

25:00.999 --> 25:03.126
I think that's why I always work so much.

25:03.919 --> 25:06.755
I've only ever gone on a single trip
my entire life.

25:06.838 --> 25:08.548
[birds chirping]

25:10.759 --> 25:12.302
Hey, don't you think that

25:12.928 --> 25:16.598
I was born to be on camera? Like just now,
I was just talking on and on on my own.

25:16.681 --> 25:17.766
[chuckles]

25:17.849 --> 25:20.518
[sighs]
Looks like you owe me another one.

25:21.144 --> 25:21.978
[Yeon-su clicks tongue]

25:24.022 --> 25:26.608
- I do have a question for you.
- What is it?

25:28.818 --> 25:30.737
How are you going to film me
if I'm riding a bike?

25:30.820 --> 25:32.155
[sucks teeth]

25:32.239 --> 25:33.573
[hums in thought]

25:33.657 --> 25:36.952
I can certainly drive, or I could just
fly a Helicam and shoot from the air,

25:37.535 --> 25:39.412
or set up a camera from far away.

25:39.496 --> 25:41.748
In any case, it's not
gonna be easy, but it's possible.

25:41.831 --> 25:42.958
Mm.

25:43.041 --> 25:44.125
Gonna ride a bike?

25:45.502 --> 25:46.336
All right.

25:46.419 --> 25:47.629
- Let me just call the others to set up--
- No, don't.

25:48.421 --> 25:49.381
Let's make this simple.

25:50.632 --> 25:52.842
- That's gonna be a headache for me, sorry.
- Exactly.

25:52.926 --> 25:54.052
[chuckles]

25:55.053 --> 25:57.639
- I never saw you this childish back then.
- So it's a no?

25:59.015 --> 26:00.642
[breathing heavily]

26:00.725 --> 26:03.353
What are you doing? Get over there.
You're gonna miss me.

26:03.937 --> 26:05.438
[chuckles]

26:05.522 --> 26:06.481
Hey!

26:06.982 --> 26:09.317
[cheerful music]

26:12.279 --> 26:14.322
[hums in delight]

26:18.660 --> 26:19.619
[breathes sharply]

26:20.412 --> 26:22.247
[groans, pants]

26:26.918 --> 26:28.086
- Done?
- Yeah.

26:30.171 --> 26:32.299
[cheerful music continues]

26:39.347 --> 26:42.225
[gasps, chuckles]

26:50.233 --> 26:52.402
[cheerful music]

27:02.954 --> 27:05.540
- [water flowing peacefully]
- [birds chirping]

27:23.183 --> 27:24.434
Boring, isn't it?

27:25.101 --> 27:26.144
It's okay.

27:26.770 --> 27:28.813
Well, he told me
I could do whatever I wanted.

27:29.898 --> 27:31.608
I'm always this boring, just so you know.

27:31.691 --> 27:34.861
Yeah, I know. I saw all the footage
from the previous one.

27:34.944 --> 27:36.321
Yeah, I was boring back then too.

27:36.404 --> 27:38.323
That's why I knew exactly what to expect.

27:42.827 --> 27:44.704
You gotta stop hanging out with Ji-ung.

27:44.788 --> 27:46.331
You're starting to sound a lot like him.

27:47.415 --> 27:49.209
That's actually a compliment for me.

27:50.960 --> 27:52.087
[chuckles]

27:54.798 --> 27:56.091
[Ung] So how was it?

27:56.174 --> 27:57.717
That first documentary.

27:58.426 --> 28:00.178
Didn't you watch any of it?

28:00.261 --> 28:02.222
I'm sure stuff was edited out.

28:04.057 --> 28:05.517
It was very entertaining in general.

28:05.600 --> 28:09.312
If I could, I would have re-edited
some of footage and broadcast--

28:09.396 --> 28:10.230
Why is that?

28:10.313 --> 28:13.733
It's kind of a waste of potential to only
depict the lives of the top student

28:13.817 --> 28:15.527
and the worst student
in an academic setting.

28:17.195 --> 28:18.071
And why is that?

28:19.114 --> 28:21.366
You don't have to play dumb.
You know that?

28:22.617 --> 28:25.161
It's not a mystery.
After watching it just once,

28:25.245 --> 28:28.415
I could tell the exact moment when
you started developing feelings for her.

28:30.250 --> 28:32.001
[chuckles]
What, are you teasing me now?

28:32.877 --> 28:34.921
- Yeah. Just a little bit.
- [chuckles]

28:37.340 --> 28:40.385
I'm gonna say this again.
You need to stop hanging out with Ji-ung.

28:40.468 --> 28:41.386
[chuckles]

28:41.469 --> 28:43.471
[bright music]

28:47.726 --> 28:50.145
So then what about now?

28:53.106 --> 28:55.442
I mean, from your point of view,
how do we look now?

28:58.361 --> 28:59.738
[Chae-ran] I think that you're…

29:07.579 --> 29:08.997
No, that's enough.

29:09.080 --> 29:12.041
I shouldn't get involved.
No matter how easy it is.

29:12.125 --> 29:13.543
[chuckles]

29:14.544 --> 29:15.545
Wow.

29:16.171 --> 29:18.256
You're a lot more interesting
than you look, you know that?

29:18.339 --> 29:19.591
Thank you.

29:20.592 --> 29:23.553
In return, do you mind making
this sequence a little more interesting

29:23.636 --> 29:24.471
than the usual shit?

29:25.597 --> 29:26.473
[chuckles]

29:26.556 --> 29:28.516
Yes, ma'am. I'll do my best.

29:30.894 --> 29:33.146
[bright music continues]

29:39.110 --> 29:40.153
[music fades]

29:47.118 --> 29:48.787
Why aren't you tired like me?

29:48.870 --> 29:51.080
Why does it feel like
I'm the only one exhausted?

29:51.164 --> 29:52.499
[sighs]

29:53.708 --> 29:56.252
Yeon-su, good stamina is a must
if you wanna be a producer.

29:56.336 --> 29:58.171
[Yeon-su] Good stamina, blah-blah.

29:58.963 --> 30:02.008
That's right, you're on
the athletic team back in high school.

30:03.009 --> 30:03.843
You remember all that?

30:03.927 --> 30:06.554
Of course I do.
You were always running under the sun.

30:06.638 --> 30:10.391
And what's even more impressive,
Ung lying in the shade instead of running.

30:15.563 --> 30:17.023
[hums in relief]

30:17.816 --> 30:18.983
So nice here.

30:23.363 --> 30:24.447
[sighs]

30:25.698 --> 30:27.700
[wind gusting]

30:36.042 --> 30:38.628
I could totally fall asleep right now.

30:38.711 --> 30:41.840
You've probably been real tired
since we left early in the morning.

30:41.923 --> 30:45.218
I never understood those people
who nap under the shade.

30:47.053 --> 30:48.721
So this is how it feels like.

30:49.597 --> 30:51.724
Just take a nap. Not in a rush.

30:53.768 --> 30:56.771
But if I take a nap now,
I won't be able to sleep tonight.

31:01.985 --> 31:04.279
[soft gentle music]

31:22.338 --> 31:23.882
Hello.
[woman 1 chuckles]

31:23.965 --> 31:27.844
Well, you're a new face around here,
aren't you? Are you visiting?

31:27.927 --> 31:29.762
Uh, yeah. We'll be staying for a few days.

31:29.846 --> 31:33.349
Oh, you guys must be on a vacation trip.

31:33.433 --> 31:35.977
I mean, why else would you come up
when there's nothing to do here?

31:36.060 --> 31:37.604
The scenery is nice, right?

31:37.687 --> 31:39.772
Uh-huh, it's a beautiful village.

31:39.856 --> 31:41.816
It's all quiet, and the air is fresh.

31:42.400 --> 31:44.903
There's a small hill over there.
You can get there easily.

31:44.986 --> 31:46.905
[woman 1] You have to check out
the view from up there,

31:46.988 --> 31:49.616
I swear it looks breathtaking
during the sunset.

31:49.699 --> 31:50.783
Just trust me.

31:50.867 --> 31:53.286
Wake up your girlfriend later,
then go check it out.

31:53.369 --> 31:55.038
I will. Thank you very much.

31:55.121 --> 31:56.331
[women chuckling]

31:56.414 --> 31:59.792
Oh, my goodness. To be young again

31:59.876 --> 32:01.836
- and madly in love.
- [woman 2] Tell me about it.

32:02.921 --> 32:04.255
[woman 1] Come on, let's hurry.

32:05.673 --> 32:07.842
[Yeon-su] So what?
I'm your girlfriend now.

32:09.928 --> 32:12.555
Not to mention,
we're young and madly in love.

32:15.224 --> 32:16.351
Hmm?

32:22.273 --> 32:25.860
You heard how they were. I just
couldn't be bothered to correct them.

32:27.570 --> 32:29.989
That's right.
They didn't mean anything by it.

32:30.865 --> 32:31.908
[chuckles]

32:31.991 --> 32:34.035
[soft music]

32:36.204 --> 32:37.038
[hums in relief]

32:40.124 --> 32:41.459
[Yeon-su sighs]

32:42.961 --> 32:45.421
Hey, you're back.
I took out the lighting equipment.

32:46.589 --> 32:49.384
[Sol-i] Finally back.
Yo, did you see Eun-ho by any chance?

32:49.467 --> 32:50.468
Why? Where'd he go?

32:50.551 --> 32:53.805
Well, we drove out a little while ago,
and then I left him after a bit.

32:53.888 --> 32:55.932
[chuckles]
Well done. But why?

32:57.016 --> 33:00.186
It's just his mouth.
He's extremely chatty.

33:00.269 --> 33:01.813
I couldn't take all that yip-yapping.

33:01.896 --> 33:04.273
Christ, that guy is such a nag.

33:04.357 --> 33:05.775
I get it. Well done.

33:09.404 --> 33:12.490
Also, aren't are Ji-ung and Yeon-su
back from the village yet?

33:12.573 --> 33:14.158
Mm. They're still out there.

33:14.242 --> 33:16.244
I didn't see them
during my walk back either.

33:16.327 --> 33:17.453
They must have gone far.

33:17.537 --> 33:19.163
[birds chirping]

33:20.832 --> 33:22.458
It's getting a little late, though.

33:23.376 --> 33:24.877
I'm sure they're on their way back.

33:25.712 --> 33:28.381
[Sol-i groaning]
I'm so tired of resting out here.

33:28.464 --> 33:29.966
I'm already missing Seoul.

33:32.552 --> 33:33.678
[Eun-ho] What gives?

33:33.761 --> 33:36.180
- [Sol-i chuckles]
- How could you just abandon me?

33:37.306 --> 33:40.351
I've walked 7km, non-stop,
in these godforsaken sandals.

33:40.435 --> 33:44.063
Wow! It's Eun-ho and he's come back
dirty and in tatters!

33:44.147 --> 33:45.606
[Sol-i laughing]

33:46.357 --> 33:48.317
[Sol-i] Hey. I'll give you
a piggyback ride, here.

33:48.401 --> 33:50.278
[Eun-ho] Forget it. Get away from me.

33:50.361 --> 33:52.155
Do you even know how much pain I'm in?

33:52.238 --> 33:54.782
[Sol-i] There's leaves
in between his toes, look at that.

33:55.825 --> 33:59.370
- [Ho] Let's go. Come on.
- [Yeon-ok] I'm coming.

33:59.454 --> 34:01.789
- There we go.
- We've never closed this early before.

34:01.873 --> 34:03.416
Oh, we're all out of ingredients.

34:03.499 --> 34:05.668
So let's close the other place,
have a nightcap,

34:05.752 --> 34:07.587
lock it all down and then call it a day.

34:07.670 --> 34:08.838
- Oh.
- Oh, my.

34:09.505 --> 34:10.339
[NJ] Are you closed already?

34:10.423 --> 34:13.509
I'm sorry. It's rare,
but we had to close down early today.

34:13.593 --> 34:16.054
Yeah, you see, we ran out of ingredients.

34:16.137 --> 34:17.930
[NJ] So it's completely empty in there?

34:18.014 --> 34:19.140
[Yeon-ok] Yes.

34:19.223 --> 34:20.850
That's actually better for me.

34:20.933 --> 34:23.061
Hmm? Hold on a second.

34:23.144 --> 34:24.937
Doesn't she look familiar?

34:25.021 --> 34:26.856
Is Mr. Choi Ung not here?

34:26.939 --> 34:30.526
Oh, are you one of his fans
from his drawing show?

34:30.610 --> 34:33.112
That's right, I am, but I'm also here
because he owes me.

34:33.696 --> 34:34.530
[gasps loudly]

34:37.575 --> 34:39.035
[Sol-i chuckles]

34:40.620 --> 34:42.330
- Try some it. Just taste it.
- What?

34:46.876 --> 34:49.170
- It's a bit bland.
- A bit bland?

34:49.253 --> 34:51.214
This is bland? Is he serious?

34:52.840 --> 34:53.841
[Eun-ho] Wow.

34:56.302 --> 34:58.262
Yeon-su, try this.

35:03.059 --> 35:05.019
Is it bland? Goddamnit, it can't be.

35:06.062 --> 35:08.147
- Do we have salt out here?
- Yes, it's right over there.

35:10.399 --> 35:11.943
[Ji-ung] Come out. What are you doing?

35:12.026 --> 35:13.653
Let's all eat some dinner
and call it a day.

35:15.071 --> 35:17.782
- You must have been real busy.
- I guess so. Why?

35:18.825 --> 35:21.494
It's just… well, you came back real late.

35:22.286 --> 35:23.371
With Yeon-su.

35:27.625 --> 35:28.584
Never mind.

35:29.293 --> 35:31.754
Oh. And please don't let your staff
take after you too much.

35:32.755 --> 35:34.799
I'm guessing Chae-ran
must have done really well.

35:35.466 --> 35:37.301
You're a bad influence, that's for sure.

35:51.482 --> 35:55.194
Ah. Eat up, you deserve it.
You had a tough day.

35:55.278 --> 35:57.947
Sol-i, I can't feel my legs,
no matter what I do. Will I be okay?

35:58.030 --> 36:00.032
It's okay.
Rest up, and you'll be just fine.

36:00.116 --> 36:02.827
My hands keep trembling too.
Why won't it stop?

36:02.910 --> 36:05.371
You're just being sensitive.
Come on. Dig in.

36:06.455 --> 36:09.584
Drinks later? You guys
better not be planning on sleeping early.

36:09.667 --> 36:11.961
We'll be drinking all night,
so make sure to eat up.

36:12.044 --> 36:14.213
Right. Where'd you guys go today?

36:14.297 --> 36:17.216
And what took you so long
to get back here? Somewhere nice perhaps?

36:17.300 --> 36:20.970
Well, we… we took
a bike ride all around the village,

36:21.554 --> 36:22.805
took a nap after that.

36:23.389 --> 36:25.391
A nap? Outdoors?

36:25.474 --> 36:27.268
Mm-hm. Why?

36:28.227 --> 36:30.897
Nothing. I thought you said
people who took naps were pathetic?

36:30.980 --> 36:33.149
[quirky music]

36:34.233 --> 36:36.903
I'm on a vacation trip.
I can do whatever I want.

36:37.695 --> 36:39.488
Really? You sure don't like

36:39.572 --> 36:42.408
having a tightly packed schedule to follow
when you're out on a trip?

36:43.743 --> 36:46.287
No. Not every time.
And it also depends on who I'm with.

36:47.163 --> 36:48.414
[scoffs]

36:48.497 --> 36:51.876
- You must have been on quite a few trips.
- Yup. That's right.

36:51.959 --> 36:52.835
[coughs]

36:52.919 --> 36:54.962
[quirky music continues]

36:57.757 --> 36:58.925
- [coughs]
- [phone buzzing]

36:59.008 --> 37:01.219
- Oh, you're getting a call.
- [Sol-i] Really? He is?

37:01.302 --> 37:02.470
Oh, it's your dad. Look.

37:03.054 --> 37:04.388
Huh? He wants a video call?

37:04.972 --> 37:05.932
I didn't know he knew how.

37:06.599 --> 37:07.725
[Ung] Weird, he's never done it before.

37:07.808 --> 37:10.228
Must be something really important.
Pick it up. Go.

37:11.354 --> 37:12.438
The reception's poor.

37:12.939 --> 37:14.649
[phone continues buzzing]

37:15.900 --> 37:17.652
[Yeon-ok] Oh, there he is.

37:17.735 --> 37:20.947
Oh. Hi, Ungie. What's up?

37:21.030 --> 37:22.406
Did you get to your cottage safely?

37:22.490 --> 37:24.075
We told you that as soon as you got there,

37:24.158 --> 37:26.160
you should call us so that
we wouldn't have to worry.

37:26.244 --> 37:29.247
Hold on. Who taught you
how to make video calls on the phone?

37:29.747 --> 37:31.958
- Ji-ung's with you, right? How is he?
- [sighs]

37:32.583 --> 37:35.086
- Good. See, your honorary son's here.
- Hi!

37:35.169 --> 37:37.922
- Oh, hi, Ji-ung! Hello.
- [chuckles]

37:38.005 --> 37:39.966
Are you all having dinner
over there right now?

37:40.049 --> 37:42.510
[Ho] Who else is there?
Is Yeon-su over there with you?

37:42.593 --> 37:44.845
- Oh…
- Yes, I'm here too.

37:44.929 --> 37:46.597
I'm good here.
Have you two had your dinner yet?

37:46.681 --> 37:48.266
Yes, of course, we did.

37:48.349 --> 37:51.143
How is the weather over there?
Is it lovely? Are you eating well?

37:51.227 --> 37:54.355
Yeah, I'm loving it out here. The scenery
is beautiful, and there is fresh air.

37:54.438 --> 37:57.233
You know, you two should take a break
sometime and plan a vacation out here too.

37:57.316 --> 38:00.695
Of course. Why not? We can ask Ung
to take care of the restaurant

38:00.778 --> 38:02.989
and serve the customers,
while we both go on a trip.

38:03.072 --> 38:04.949
Oh, right. Hey, Ung, guess what?

38:05.032 --> 38:06.784
You have a friend here
who wants to see you.

38:07.827 --> 38:08.828
A friend?

38:09.745 --> 38:11.414
But all my friends are here.

38:11.497 --> 38:12.456
I'm disappointed.

38:12.540 --> 38:15.293
Oh? NJ! Hey. What are you doing?

38:15.376 --> 38:16.961
What? Did you say NJ?

38:17.044 --> 38:18.129
- [clinks]
- Ow!

38:18.212 --> 38:20.506
You making a shrine?
Pull it out, that's rude.

38:21.882 --> 38:24.218
I hope you're not out there
so you can run away from me.

38:24.302 --> 38:26.053
Oh, hang on.

38:26.721 --> 38:28.597
[Ung] Hey, I'll be back, okay?

38:28.681 --> 38:30.308
- Me too. Let's--
- Sit down.

38:31.434 --> 38:33.811
[soft music]

38:45.781 --> 38:47.867
[soft music continues]

38:56.542 --> 38:58.878
[soft music]

39:04.258 --> 39:05.426
[gulps]

39:06.177 --> 39:07.553
[door closes]

39:08.137 --> 39:09.221
[gulps]

39:18.522 --> 39:19.940
[sighs]

39:30.117 --> 39:31.035
[sighs]

39:31.118 --> 39:33.913
[Yeon-su] Why am I avoiding him?
I'm such a fool.

39:43.381 --> 39:44.215
[thuds]

39:50.554 --> 39:51.597
[sighs]

40:04.193 --> 40:05.361
[dial tone]

40:11.492 --> 40:12.701
Hi, Grandma.

40:13.661 --> 40:14.745
Sleeping?

40:15.996 --> 40:17.915
Oh, I must have woken you up.

40:19.708 --> 40:21.794
Yeah, I can tell by your tired voice.

40:31.053 --> 40:32.221
- What?
- [groans]

40:32.304 --> 40:35.516
Nothing. Hey, sleep early
for tomorrow's shoot..

40:35.599 --> 40:39.103
Hey, you realize you're telling me
to sleep and it's not even 10 p.m. yet?

40:39.854 --> 40:42.148
- The pills?
- Nope, didn't have time to pack them.

40:43.566 --> 40:45.401
Maybe you want some hot milk or something?

40:45.484 --> 40:48.112
I'm fine. Where are you sleeping?

40:48.195 --> 40:50.698
We got our own place somewhere else.
We'll be back tomorrow morning.

40:51.449 --> 40:52.408
Okay.

41:02.001 --> 41:03.085
What is it?

41:03.169 --> 41:04.253
Can you just say it already,

41:04.336 --> 41:06.422
otherwise you'll be
sitting there all night.

41:07.465 --> 41:09.049
We're changing the angle.

41:09.842 --> 41:12.636
We're gonna be focussing more on
the underlying emotions between you two.

41:12.720 --> 41:13.971
But what?

41:14.054 --> 41:15.890
Gotta say, I'm a little confused.

41:15.973 --> 41:18.350
I'm wondering if you're showing
all these emotions because…

41:19.143 --> 41:21.520
you feel uncomfortable about
what happened to you in the past,

41:21.604 --> 41:23.230
or maybe because…

41:24.356 --> 41:25.524
Maybe because?

41:31.155 --> 41:32.865
Ms. Jung told me something today

41:34.366 --> 41:36.785
that those behind the camera
shouldn't get too involved.

41:39.914 --> 41:41.373
What are you curious about?

41:43.417 --> 41:44.960
That's the issue I'm having.

41:47.755 --> 41:49.089
'Cause when I'm filming you two…

41:54.303 --> 41:57.640
I guess I'm too curious.
Next time. Good night then.

42:00.643 --> 42:03.562
- [soft pensive music]
- [door slides close]

42:06.273 --> 42:08.192
[sighs deeply]

42:18.494 --> 42:19.495
[groans]

42:27.461 --> 42:29.588
["Summer Rain" by Sam Kim playing]

42:31.507 --> 42:33.634
It really feels like you're back, Yeon-su.

42:34.301 --> 42:36.512
I'm really sick of this.

42:40.683 --> 42:42.518
[Ung] I'm sure you agree on some level.

42:43.102 --> 42:44.562
I know that you're sick of this.

42:46.438 --> 42:49.191
We fight, we run away,
and then we avoid each other.

42:49.275 --> 42:50.609
That's what we do.

42:51.402 --> 42:52.945
But despite that, we're here.

42:54.572 --> 42:55.864
What can we do, right?

42:56.699 --> 42:58.742
[soft music]

42:58.826 --> 42:59.785
[sighs]

43:08.002 --> 43:09.336
- I'm so disappointed.
- [gasps]

43:10.546 --> 43:13.841
Hang on. Hey, I'll be back, okay?

43:19.179 --> 43:21.265
None of that is any of my business now.

43:22.474 --> 43:23.559
Just forget about it.

43:24.351 --> 43:25.269
[huffs]

43:28.606 --> 43:30.566
[Ji-ung] Which trip
was the most memorable for you?

43:32.359 --> 43:35.821
I'm not sure. Don't really enjoy
going on trips and stuff.

43:35.904 --> 43:37.656
Nothing fun or memorable about it.

43:37.740 --> 43:40.075
[inhales, sighs]

43:41.535 --> 43:45.331
["Summer Rain" by Sam Kim continues]

43:52.546 --> 43:54.256
[Yeon-su] That hurt more than it should.

44:11.440 --> 44:13.067
[Ji-ung] Gotta say, I'm a little confused.

44:13.692 --> 44:16.362
I'm wondering if you're showing
all these emotions because…

44:16.445 --> 44:18.822
you feel uncomfortable about
what happened to you in the past

44:18.906 --> 44:20.824
or maybe because…

44:27.164 --> 44:29.166
[Ung] I'm just uncomfortable
about the past.

44:30.501 --> 44:32.086
Nothing more, nothing less.

44:34.755 --> 44:36.090
But that's the problem, right?

44:37.007 --> 44:38.425
Despite being in the past…

44:40.094 --> 44:41.470
Pretty hectic day, wasn't it?

44:42.262 --> 44:44.431
This was my first trip,
so I'm not used to it.

44:45.808 --> 44:48.936
Next time, we should stay longer
and go much farther.

44:49.019 --> 44:50.688
If we ever fight again

44:51.355 --> 44:52.481
or stop talking,

44:53.941 --> 44:56.902
all you have to do is come to me,
you know, just like you did today.

45:01.198 --> 45:04.451
It's just… I think that
I'm in love with you.

45:07.663 --> 45:09.540
[Ung] …it's still all too vivid to me.

45:15.295 --> 45:17.798
["Summer Rain" by Sam Kim continues]

45:39.069 --> 45:41.530
[Sol-i] Good morning, everyone.

45:42.948 --> 45:44.700
Which one of you
shot me with a tranquilizer?

45:44.783 --> 45:46.493
Oh, that was amazing.

45:46.577 --> 45:48.996
I haven't slept this well
in a very long time.

45:49.079 --> 45:51.665
Sol-i, how could you just
fall asleep right after dinner

45:51.748 --> 45:53.625
when you said we
were gonna party all night long?

45:53.709 --> 45:55.836
By the way,
what the heck happened to your face?

45:55.919 --> 45:58.338
Did bugs swarm you
last night or something?

45:58.422 --> 46:00.382
This is how I look in the morning.

46:00.466 --> 46:02.718
[Chae-ran] Hello. Did you sleep well?
Where are the other two?

46:02.801 --> 46:05.596
Right. If your schedule
isn't too hectic today,

46:05.679 --> 46:07.264
can you maybe let Yeon-su sleep in?

46:07.347 --> 46:09.850
'Cause she probably hasn't slept
like that in ages.

46:09.933 --> 46:11.393
[Eun-ho] Same with Ung.

46:11.477 --> 46:13.687
I'm guessing he slept a bit late
after drawing all night.

46:13.770 --> 46:15.814
Why the hell would he work
during a relaxing trip?

46:15.898 --> 46:17.232
It's heartbreaking.

46:17.316 --> 46:20.110
All right. Let's just take it easy.
After all, they are on vacation.

46:20.194 --> 46:21.987
Let's use this time to check out the site.

46:22.070 --> 46:24.656
By the way, you don't have to worry
about what to shoot.

46:25.407 --> 46:26.408
Shoot us instead.

46:26.492 --> 46:29.036
That's right. We're the sacrifice.
[chuckles]

46:30.037 --> 46:31.121
- Let's wrap up.
- [Chae-ran] Yup.

46:38.295 --> 46:39.254
Sol-i.

46:56.104 --> 46:57.898
[Yeon-su] Whoa. Where is everyone?

47:04.112 --> 47:05.239
[groans]

47:14.164 --> 47:16.083
Anyone in there?

47:20.963 --> 47:22.130
[knocking]

48:11.305 --> 48:13.765
[Yeon-su] I wonder
if he's having trouble sleeping again?

48:52.304 --> 48:54.306
[gentle piano music]

49:14.201 --> 49:15.452
[Yeon-su exhales]

49:23.335 --> 49:25.295
[door slides close]

49:27.506 --> 49:29.758
[gentle piano music]

49:40.977 --> 49:43.021
[birds chirping]

49:54.199 --> 49:55.367
Was he awake?

49:57.202 --> 49:58.078
Yeon-su.

50:00.330 --> 50:01.206
Yeon-su?

50:02.290 --> 50:03.125
Yes?

50:03.208 --> 50:05.585
Anything on your mind
that's distracting you?

50:05.669 --> 50:08.338
[chuckles awkwardly]
What did you say again?

50:08.422 --> 50:10.590
We'll just finish the interview
while we're on our way down.

50:10.674 --> 50:12.551
One of the villagers told us
about this place

50:12.634 --> 50:14.136
that's supposed to be beautiful
during the sunset.

50:14.219 --> 50:15.679
Yeah. Sure thing.

50:20.851 --> 50:22.894
- Oh, let me just change the battery.
- Mm-hmm.

50:25.522 --> 50:27.441
Aren't you supposed to be
with Chae-ran right now?

50:27.524 --> 50:29.860
[Tae-hun] She told me to stay with you
in case you needed me.

50:29.943 --> 50:31.653
That's weird. I thought I was the boss.

50:31.737 --> 50:34.030
Yes, you are. But you gotta admit,
I made the right choice.

50:34.114 --> 50:36.283
Great, why is she making me
do all the babysitting?

50:36.908 --> 50:39.161
[woman 1] Oh.
You're that guy from yesterday.

50:39.244 --> 50:40.996
Oh, hello. Nice to see you again.

50:41.079 --> 50:42.789
You all must have come in a big group.

50:42.873 --> 50:45.000
- Plus, you're all so handsome.
- [chuckles]

50:45.083 --> 50:47.085
- Where are you headed?
- Going home, of course.

50:47.169 --> 50:50.380
Oh, right. You visited that place
with your girlfriend?

50:50.464 --> 50:52.507
Oh, she's probably
on her way here right now.

50:52.591 --> 50:56.178
Oh, well you can't do it today.
It's going to rain soon.

50:56.261 --> 50:58.096
No, I seriously doubt it.

50:58.180 --> 51:01.391
Are you kidding?
Don't you see how cloudy it is today?

51:01.475 --> 51:04.853
You should hurry and get indoors.
If you don't wanna end up wet that is.

51:04.936 --> 51:08.356
You should have gone there yesterday.
It's such a beautiful place.

51:08.440 --> 51:10.525
[somber music]

51:10.609 --> 51:12.861
[Chae-ran] Let's do
our final interview around this area.

51:12.944 --> 51:14.988
Give me the overall thoughts
you've had on this trip.

51:15.071 --> 51:15.989
Okay.

51:17.324 --> 51:20.410
Uh… Hold on a minute. I'm low on battery.

51:21.119 --> 51:22.871
This thing might turn off midway through.

51:23.705 --> 51:24.915
I should have packed an extra one.

51:24.998 --> 51:27.167
I feel like
this has already happened before.

51:28.335 --> 51:29.544
Is it a déjà vu?

51:31.004 --> 51:33.548
Should we just go back
to the village and finish up there?

51:33.632 --> 51:37.886
Oh, it's okay. Don't waste the moment.
You said the view was beautiful.

51:37.969 --> 51:41.223
Okay. Just sit tight, I'll go back and get
some extra batteries and lightings up.

51:41.306 --> 51:42.682
Please wait from right here.

51:46.812 --> 51:47.979
[Yeon-su sighs]

51:55.529 --> 51:56.947
[breathes in deeply]

52:00.075 --> 52:01.493
[sighs deeply]

52:01.576 --> 52:04.329
[Yeon-su] It feels like I've been
spending extra effort lately,

52:04.412 --> 52:06.957
not to mention a bit of time
just to avoid Ung.

52:12.379 --> 52:13.713
[groans]

52:20.053 --> 52:21.263
Sol-i.

52:21.346 --> 52:22.305
Hmm?

52:23.098 --> 52:24.808
I have a question I wanted to ask.

52:26.643 --> 52:27.894
Okay. I'm listening.

52:29.396 --> 52:30.689
What are we…

52:32.190 --> 52:33.567
having for dinner tonight?

52:35.026 --> 52:38.530
Hmm. You're always curious
about the most useless shit, you know.

52:38.613 --> 52:40.282
It's actually important to me.

52:40.907 --> 52:42.951
Go and light a fire first,
if you're that hungry.

52:43.034 --> 52:45.537
That's cold.
How about you say it, don't spray it.

52:45.620 --> 52:46.913
You filthy garden hose.

52:48.164 --> 52:52.043
Geez. You know, you have a knack
for saying the rudest shit possible.

52:52.127 --> 52:54.921
- Hey. My spit would land on me, not you.
- Ow.

52:55.005 --> 52:57.173
You freaking idiot. Oh, cold.

52:57.257 --> 52:58.300
- Huh?
- [rain pattering]

52:58.383 --> 52:59.551
I just got hit too.

52:59.634 --> 53:00.927
- What's this?
- What?

53:01.011 --> 53:02.220
It's raining?

53:03.471 --> 53:06.224
- What? Out of nowhere?
- Oh, shit.

53:06.308 --> 53:07.976
- Damn it.
- [Eun-ho] Quick! Back inside.

53:08.059 --> 53:10.687
- Oh, I spent an hour on my hair!
- I told you we should have stayed in!

53:10.770 --> 53:11.938
Let's hurry.

53:12.022 --> 53:13.732
[rain pattering]

53:28.288 --> 53:29.331
What's wrong?

53:31.207 --> 53:32.667
Is it raining?

53:32.751 --> 53:34.711
No one said it's gonna rain today.

53:39.925 --> 53:42.177
[rain pattering]

53:49.559 --> 53:51.770
This is definitely a déjà vu.

53:57.484 --> 53:58.485
Mm.

54:03.323 --> 54:05.158
Gotta admit, it's refreshing.

54:12.332 --> 54:16.544
If only the rain could wash
away all these ridiculous thoughts.

54:27.222 --> 54:29.307
[rain pattering]

54:35.897 --> 54:38.525
["The Giving Tree"
by Lee Seung Yoon playing]

55:17.313 --> 55:18.773
It's really him, isn't it?

55:20.275 --> 55:22.235
[rain pattering]

55:26.489 --> 55:28.158
What are you standing out there for?

55:30.201 --> 55:31.119
Thinking.

55:32.037 --> 55:33.079
About what?

55:36.499 --> 55:39.919
Why after all this time,
I end up coming back to you. Why is that?

55:43.882 --> 55:46.009
[Ung] How do I even begin to explain this?

55:47.427 --> 55:48.845
I guess I'm just cursed.

55:53.058 --> 55:55.477
In all honesty,
you shouldn't have ever said that.

55:57.145 --> 55:59.856
So it's my fault?
You really think it's me?

56:00.565 --> 56:02.484
Hmm. It's you again.

56:03.359 --> 56:05.361
I'm so sick of it, but it's true.

56:11.451 --> 56:13.578
Feel free to leave.
Just don't get in my way.

56:16.206 --> 56:18.708
[Ung] Am I cursed
to live this desperate existence?

56:24.047 --> 56:25.590
You don't have to move, I'll go.

56:28.218 --> 56:30.929
["The Giving Tree"
by Lee Seung Yoon continues]

56:45.860 --> 56:49.155
[Ung] Did this ridiculous trip
simply cloud my emotions?

56:58.665 --> 57:00.458
Tell me now if I should leave or stay?

57:06.005 --> 57:08.383
I want you to tell me
if I should leave or stay.

57:09.676 --> 57:10.927
[Ung] Or just maybe…

57:15.849 --> 57:18.518
Ever since I saw you again,
and we were reunited…

57:20.353 --> 57:23.565
["Christmas Tree" by V playing]

58:09.027 --> 58:12.405
I knew this would happen
one way or another.

58:27.545 --> 58:29.005
We're not gonna break up.

58:30.798 --> 58:34.260
If we ever fight again or stop talking,

58:34.969 --> 58:37.972
all you have to do is come to me,
you know, just like you did today.

58:40.141 --> 58:42.101
- And then what?
- And then I'll…

58:43.603 --> 58:47.482
I'll grab onto you as high as I can,
and I'll never let you go.

58:54.531 --> 59:01.204
JANGAN, HOGOK-RI, IHWA-RI, GOON-RI

59:01.287 --> 59:03.540
BEFORE SUNSET

59:03.623 --> 59:09.379
♪ So I'll tell you
A million tiny things that ♪

59:09.462 --> 59:12.799
♪ You have never known ♪

59:13.466 --> 59:17.220
♪ It all gets tangled up inside ♪

59:17.303 --> 59:23.059
♪ And I'll tell you
A million little reasons ♪

59:23.142 --> 59:26.479
♪ I'm falling for your eyes ♪

59:30.608 --> 59:32.151
[Yeon-su] Am I really crazy?

59:32.235 --> 59:35.697
It all just kind of happened.
It's not like I was expecting it.

59:35.780 --> 59:36.781
Uh, Ms. Kook.

59:36.864 --> 59:39.200
[NJ] What's going on
between you and Ms. Kook?

59:39.284 --> 59:42.287
Why? Because he might
actually regret everything?

59:43.288 --> 59:44.497
And say it was a mistake?

59:44.581 --> 59:46.916
Ji-ung, do you actually like Yeon-su?

59:47.750 --> 59:51.004
[Yeon-su] I'm not sure what I'm expecting
from all of this, or from you.

59:51.588 --> 59:52.547
What do you have to say?

59:53.256 --> 59:55.425
[Yeon-su] And this time,
don't you dare run away.

59:56.175 --> 59:57.719
Can't you just be honest for once?
